{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_16207360","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16207360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1620735001:1":{"text":"あわわわ……こ、これはアウルベア！？またどこかの生徒が、混沌魔法を使ったに違いありません！","source_cn":"啊啊啊！这是、是枭熊？！我懂了，又一个用了混沌魔法的学生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9129CD7E403EC46A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620735002:0":{"text":"大丈夫、ボクがすぐに助けてあげる！","source_cn":"别害怕，我马上就来救你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E7873C91CEF4522","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620736001:1":{"text":"え、えええっ！？アウルベアに変身した生徒じゃなかったの！？どうしてボクの姿に……？それよりも、ボク、ホープ先生になってる！？","source_cn":"欸欸欸？！你不是被变成了枭熊的学生吗？！为什么会变成我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x009EA9258DCB81B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620736002:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620736003:1":{"text":"つまり……あ、あなたは、ホープ先生……？","source_cn":"所以……您……真的是赫普老师？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D68E90FDF0B510B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn